{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/618468-any-mention-of-a-possible-2ed-equinox-road","id":618468,"title":"Any mention of a possible 2ed Equinox Road?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-06T22:06:05-07:00","id":618468,"title":"Any mention of a possible 2ed Equinox Road?","content":"I remember that the preliminary outline for the 2ed Changeling core book said the sample Gentry won't have stats. I don't know if the developers changed their minds since then, and I am not here to demand. However, I would really appreciate some quick and dirty rules for writing their stats on Earth. If that can't be put into the core because of word count or another obstacle, no grievances either. There would be plenty of room for said rules and more in a supplement. Equinox Road already has lots of amazing suggestions for how to portray encounters and conflicts with Gentry inside their Arcadian Realms. The in-character fiction and the Game Of Immortals are also really cool. The crunch might not fit seamlessly into the GMC rules, though.<br /> <br /> I do know that YeOfLittleFaith made an awesome <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/343836-fae-actors-2e-hack\"><b>2ed hack for Fae Actors</b></a>, but there is no rule that says they require Ephemeral Being Attributes. The way their Wyrd-As-Powerstat manifests its qualities could be different, and not just regarding Glamour pools.<br /> <br /> Any thoughts are welcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 08-07-2015, 10:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https: